// Scannable stations around the house. An enforcer or host scans a
// program's pass at the station (the station's name is the character
// the performer signs in as on a spare phone taped to it, or the host
// scans "as" it from the Run cockpit). Each is one line: a `Prop(beat)`.
//
// The wall QR codes and Arduino puzzles are *not* props — they are
// CODEX entries with a `code:` (see `codex/`), scanned by the guest's
// own phone camera.

CHARACTER The Uploader is Prop(Login)
CHARACTER The Screensaver is Prop(The Screensaver)
CHARACTER The Tablet is Prop(The Tablet Video)
CHARACTER The Router is Prop(The Router)
CHARACTER The Modem is Prop(The Modem)
CHARACTER The Encyclopaedias is Prop(The Encyclopaedias)
